---
title: Icon Bar Manager
description: A plugin for hiding undesired icons in Obisdian. Many plugins install icons without offering the possibility to hide them, resulting in a cluttered interface. The plugin allows controlling the order of the few icons one wishes to use. Unfortunately, the documentation page is missing. Furthermore, the plugin is still in an alpha stage and possibly only useful to expert users who can tweak it.
link: https://github.com/alberti42/obsidian-icon-bar-manager-plugin
---
